{"game": "mass-effect-andromeda", "language": "english", "appid": 1238000, "month": "2023-02", "window": 1, "start_date": 1675209600, "end_date": 1675814399, "month_true_total": 132, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 21:57:55 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "132393207", "author": {"steamid": "76561198260166507", "personaname": "Dan.llama", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198260166507/", "num_games_owned": 138, "num_reviews": 9, "playtime_forever": 6591, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 6591, "last_played": 1675807775, "avatar": "1454c7d29372359bf8b4b3f42b4158b837f41c9c"}, "language": "english", "review": "Love the well fleshed out universe. This game is more light hearted than the other Mass Effect games if you ask me. I understand there were some issues at launch but playing now I must say I am enjoying the gameplay só much. Its very lively, the combat systems works very well, the action to story is well balanced. I like it, and hope there will be another ME game.", "timestamp_created": 1675808555, "timestamp_updated": 1675808555, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "132390598", "author": {"steamid": "76561198138027206", "personaname": "Daisy", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/DaisyLoo/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 9, "playtime_forever": 7341, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3902, "last_played": 1691330090, "avatar": "20c7b5ac17896dc8f6d17b3a688fb4a302c48fd5"}, "language": "english", "review": "7/10\n\nI played this years ago on console and was disappointed that it didn't have the same appeal as the original trilogy. \n\nI then picked it up again last year and I actually enjoyed my pkaythrough. While I didn't feel connected to the main character, the graphics are gorgeous and the side missions are fun enough. \n\nI didn't feel the storyline was fleshed out enough.\nI didn't feel that there was enough character development with some of them. No personal growth.\n\nOverall it isn't that bad of a game, it just doesn't live up to it's  predecessor.", "timestamp_created": 1675804736, "timestamp_updated": 1675804736, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "132372053", "author": {"steamid": "76561199186934850", "personaname": "Manipula", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199186934850/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 17, "playtime_forever": 336, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 336, "last_played": 1674673325, "avatar": "0374a3ca9084837d3b9a8202c81db1666aad29eb"}, "language": "english", "review": "Игра говно, много багов и со временем может вообще не запустится.", "timestamp_created": 1675779463, "timestamp_updated": 1675779463, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "132363209", "author": {"steamid": "76561198800512396", "personaname": "Is0late", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198800512396/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 4696, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 800, "last_played": 1